			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741540801,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}看，魚肉是新鮮的，地上也很乾淨，一定有人才剛打掃過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540802,
					"content": "伯努瓦家一定有人，我們過去聽聽看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540803,
					"content": "…他說的也有道理，他不能一直消失，至少要偶爾出現一下…散個步什麼的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540804,
					"content": "至少可以防止鄰居報告執律庭，我可不想招來銃槍隊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540805,
					"content": "爸爸，你很想出去散步對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540806,
					"content": "我…我可以嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒魯瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540807,
					"content": "當然可以了，不僅可以，我們還很樂意陪你出去散步呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540808,
					"content": "小心點，不要反而給他機會出門求救，那兩個怪人一直盯著這裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540809,
					"content": "爸爸不會的，我知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540810,
					"content": "爸爸，你會願意讓執律庭知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540811,
					"content": "知道什麼啊…怎麼說話這麼小聲，根本聽不清楚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540812,
					"content": "他們要出門了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540813,
					"content": "嗯，我們走遠一點好了。這次要想辦法和伯努瓦說上話，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540814,
					"content": "沒錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540815,
					"content": "好，我們快走開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540816,
					"content": "怎麼樣，爸爸？心情是不是有好一點了呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540817,
					"content": "#是{F#妳}{M#你}們！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒魯瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540818,
					"content": "伯努瓦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540819,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們救救我…不，別救我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒魯瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540820,
					"content": "爸爸在說些什麼呀？什麼救不救的？呵呵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540821,
					"content": "#哦，是{F#妳}{M#你}們啊…難怪爸爸要特意跟{F#妳}{M#你}們打招呼，原來是熟人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540822,
					"content": "…沒有，不是的！我們不熟、不熟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒魯瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540823,
					"content": "#不熟？怎麼會呢？我看{F#她}{M#他}們是特地在這裡等著你的呀，爸爸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540824,
					"content": "#{F#她}{M#他}們還好心幫我們拿了報紙，又去灰河找了我們以前的鄰居史諾德格拉斯聊天。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540825,
					"content": "我想你們應該是很親近的，畢竟爸爸一向很愛孩子的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540826,
					"content": "我也很愛孩子，不過我不像爸爸那麼無私，我最愛自己的孩子，可惜她不見了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540827,
						741540829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540827,
					"content": "你們到底在做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540828
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540828,
					"content": "我和阿托斯是爸爸的孩子，爸爸愛我們，所以我們也愛爸爸——這不是很明顯嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540831,
					"content": "莫蒂西婭，妳看今天天氣多好，多適合散步啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540832,
					"content": "對啊，阿托斯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540833
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540833,
					"content": "今天的《蒸汽鳥報》妳看了嗎？有很多非常有趣的新聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540834,
					"content": "還沒有呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540835,
					"content": "有一則是關於不幸身亡的老年人，據說他在無人監護的情況下遇到了強盜，因此不慎摔下山崖，就這樣摔死了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540836,
					"content": "是嗎？那太淒慘了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540837,
					"content": "還有一則是關於一位不幸溺死的商人，他好像是喝酒喝醉了，昏頭昏腦地走到了湖裡，就這麼淹死了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540838,
					"content": "啊！我的天，太不幸了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540839,
					"content": "#最後一則最有趣，是一位愛多管閒事的濫好人，唉！{M#他}{F#她}不小心吃錯了藥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540840,
					"content": "把毒藥當成了治病的藥，就這樣吃了下去，結果死得極其痛苦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540841,
					"content": "我的天啊，人的死法真多，再多講一點吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540842,
					"content": "…對不起，對不起，我不會再這麼做了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伯努瓦·勒魯瓦"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540843,
					"content": "爸爸在說什麼呢？我們才沒有怪你的意思，不過你跑了這一段路，應該很累了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540844,
					"content": "阿托斯，我們回去一起讀報給爸爸聽好了，爸爸不是訂了很多報紙嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540845,
					"content": "是啊，聊得夠多了，該回去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿托斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540846,
					"content": "我們回去吧，親愛的爸爸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 741540829,
					"content": "你們為什麼要這樣做？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540830
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741540830,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}是指陪爸爸出來散步嗎？這是作為子女應盡的義務，否則我怎麼對得起爸爸對我的關愛呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741540831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫蒂西婭"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}